      "description": "The attacker-controlled top-level `\"Type\":22` field is converted into namespace-0 DataType dispatch state here. On the witnessed path, numeric type id 22 resolves to the built-in `ExtensionObject` type and is stored in `dst->type`, which is the state that sends the Variant body into the vulnerable unwrap helper."
