      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_root_error_cleanup_clears_variant_data",
      "fine_trace_step": 8,
      "description": "Error cleanup frees the allocated unwrapped body structure but does not clear `dst->data`. The fixing commit adds `dst->data = NULL;` immediately after this free, so later `UA_deleteMembers()` / `Variant_clear()` cleanup on the same partially built Variant no longer reuses the freed pointer."
    },
