      "fine_trace_step": 14,
      "description": "AddressSanitizer sink. Cleanup has already freed the 136-byte `CreateSubscriptionRequest` buffer, but later generic Variant cleanup re-enters that stale object and descends through `CreateSubscriptionRequest.requestHeader.authenticationToken` to `NodeId_clear()`. Reading `p->identifierType` here is the observed 4-byte heap-use-after-free read."
